Scope. This license covers the github-mcp server (github-mcp.pl), the proxy in
proxy/, and the tests in t/.

The server runs on whatever Perl interpreter the user has installed. Perl 5 is
itself free software under the Artistic License 1.0 or the GNU General Public
License, and it is not distributed with this repository. Running a script
through an interpreter does not make the script a derivative work of the
interpreter, so Perl's license reaches nothing in this repository and nothing
in an application that starts it.

The third-party Perl modules the server loads (JSON, and the core modules
shipped with Perl) are installed by the user from their own sources and keep
their own licenses.
